@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

title Diagrama de Sequência - Abertura de Chamado

actor "Funcionário" as Funcionario
boundary "Web App" as Web
control "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Ticket Service" as Ticket
database "Ticket DB" as DB
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "Notification Service" as Notify
boundary "Serviço de E-mail" as Email

autonumber
Funcionario -> Web : Preencher e enviar formulário
activate Web

Web -> Gateway : POST /api/chamados
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Ticket : Encaminha requisição
activate Ticket

Ticket -> DB : Persistir dados do chamado
activate DB
DB --> Ticket : Confirmação (ID gerado)
deactivate DB

Ticket -->> MQ : Publicar evento (TicketCreated)
Ticket --> Gateway : Retorna 201 Created
deactivate Ticket

Gateway --> Web : Retorna 201 Created
deactivate Gateway

Web --> Funcionario : Exibe sucesso na tela
deactivate Web

== Processamento Assíncrono ==
MQ -->> Notify : Consome evento (TicketCreated)
activate Notify
Notify -> Email : Dispara e-mail de confirmação
activate Email
Email -->> Funcionario : Entrega notificação de abertura
deactivate Email
deactivate Notify

@enduml